<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Calendar Copycat</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 50px auto;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    h1 { color: #3498db; }
    h2 { color: #34495e; margin-top: 30px; }
    .card {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background: #3498db;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 5px;
    }
    .button:hover { background: #2980b9; }
    pre {
      background: #282c34;
      color: #abb2bf;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    ul { margin: 10px 0; }
    li { margin: 5px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>📅 Calendar Copycat</h1>
  
  <p>A Ruby/Sinatra application that synchronizes Google Calendar events between multiple accounts based on configurable rules.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>🚀 Quick Start</h2>
    
    <h3>1. Setup OAuth Credentials</h3>
    <p>Set your Google OAuth credentials as environment variables:</p>
    <pre>GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret</pre>
    
    <h3>2. Authenticate Accounts</h3>
    <p>Click the links below to authenticate each Google account:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/auth/personal" class="button">Authenticate Personal Account</a></li>
      <li><a href="/auth/work" class="button">Authenticate Work Account</a></li>
    </ul>
    
    <h3>3. Configure Rules</h3>
    <p>Edit <code>config/rules.yaml</code> to define your sync rules.</p>
    
    <h3>4. Test Sync</h3>
    <form action="/sync" method="post" style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <button type="submit" class="button">▶️ Run Sync Now</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>📊 Status</h2>
    <p><a href="/status" class="button">View Status</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>📚 Documentation</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>See <code>docs/build.md</code> for complete specifications</li>
      <li>See <code>README.md</code> for setup instructions</li>
      <li>Configuration: <code>config/rules.yaml</code></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
